title: $:/language/hypergsd/Lists/

# Ticklers additions to the shared Lists namespace (dashboard + row suffix), grouped under the Ticklers umbrella the Sections and Settings namespaces already use.
Ticklers/Requiring: Ticklers requiring action
Ticklers/Upcoming: Upcoming ticklers
Ticklers/Old: Old ticklers
Ticklers/Old/Show: show old ticklers...
Ticklers/Old/Hide: hide old ticklers